# ScrapeWork

Personal freelance intelligence watchtower + pitch engine (OnlineJobs.ph, Upwork, Fiverr → LLM score/pitches → Supabase → dashboard + Telegram/Discord).

Before coding, read `.cursorrules/AGENTS.md` and the relevant doc in `.cursorrules/` (`MVP.md`, `architecture.md`, `stack.md`, `scraping.md`, `ui.md`, `schema.md`).

## Non-negotiables

- Do not auto-submit applications or message clients — drafts and links only.
- Never commit secrets (cookies, API keys, `.env`, session storage).
- Staggered polling with jitter; no aggressive scraping.
- Validate LLM JSON before DB writes; alert only when `match_score >= 75`.
- Scrapers extract only; n8n/LLM enrich; `web/` reads Supabase — keep those boundaries.

## Layout

Packages: `web/`, `scrapers/`, `supabase/`, `n8n/`. Dashboard Route Handlers: `web/app/api/`. Put new code in the matching package only.
